# REQUIRES: verilator
# Ring copies in the static port (--vport-copy): a ring memory on a static port
# keeps its image in that port's region (rows {image member, instance}); its
# reads carry rd_copy and the image row (the port writes the answer there and
# answers rsp_copied, no data); the ring's prefetches are reads of the image at
# their own positions on that port with rd_after (after every earlier copy's
# B): no image controller, answer queue, table of reads in flight or prefetch
# queue in the simulator. Against the target from zero state (tb_vmem_multi.sv,
# each port a real foldsim_vport with COPY on vport_axi_model.sv: writes
# applied at their B, reads sampled at AR), 1 to 600 host cycles, stalls,
# bubbles; with class control and stagger, the port's table (HZ 8) and fence
# classes; a ring whose prefetches fall at its own positions keeps an image of
# its own (COPY 0).
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/vmemring
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/c --static --modulo --bubbles --min-ii 160 --virtual-memories 'Leaf:.*' --vmem-rings 16 --page-engines 16 --vmem-on-engines --vport-engines --vport-hz 8 --vport-copy Leaf > %t/c.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=VH < %t/c/foldsim_sim.vh
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SV < %t/c/foldsim_sim.sv
# RUN: python3 %S/Inputs/vmem_bind.py %t/c/foldsim_sim.json %t/c
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -DVMEM_DEPTH=16 -DVMEM_ROWS=1024 -I%t/c -Mdir %t/c/obj %S/Inputs/tb_vmem_multi.sv %S/Inputs/vport_axi_model.sv %S/../../shell/rtl/foldsim_vport.sv top.sv %t/c/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/c/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/c/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+1 +lo=1 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/c/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+2 +lo=5 +hi=60 +full=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/c/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+3 +lo=1 +hi=600 +stall=30 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/c/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+4 +lo=1 +hi=600 +bubble=90 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/g --static --modulo --min-ii 160 --virtual-memories 'Leaf:.*' --vmem-rings 16 --vmem-ring-class-control --page-engines 16 --vmem-on-engines --vmem-stagger 7 --vport-engines --vport-fence-shift 2 --vport-copy Leaf > %t/g.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=VH < %t/g/foldsim_sim.vh
# RUN: python3 %S/Inputs/vmem_bind.py %t/g/foldsim_sim.json %t/g
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -DVMEM_DEPTH=16 -DVMEM_ROWS=1024 -I%t/g -Mdir %t/g/obj %S/Inputs/tb_vmem_multi.sv %S/Inputs/vport_axi_model.sv %S/../../shell/rtl/foldsim_vport.sv top.sv %t/g/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/g/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/g/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+5 +lo=5 +hi=60 +full=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/own --static --modulo --min-ii 160 --virtual-memories 'Leaf:.*' --vmem-rings 4 --page-engines 16 --vmem-on-engines --vport-engines --vport-hz 8 --vport-copy Leaf > %t/own.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=OWN < %t/own/foldsim_sim.vh
# RUN: python3 %S/Inputs/vmem_bind.py %t/own/foldsim_sim.json %t/own
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -DVMEM_DEPTH=16 -DVMEM_ROWS=1024 -I%t/own -Mdir %t/own/obj %S/Inputs/tb_vmem_multi.sv %S/Inputs/vport_axi_model.sv %S/../../shell/rtl/foldsim_vport.sv top.sv %t/own/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/own/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/own/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+6 +lo=1 +hi=600 +stall=30 | FileCheck %s

# VH: `define FOLDSIM_VPORTS 1
# VH: `define FOLDSIM_VPORT0_COPY 1
# SV-NOT: ring_flight
# SV-NOT: _qhead
# SV: assign vp0_rd_after = {{.*}}ring_pref0
# OWN: `define FOLDSIM_VPORT0_COPY 0
# CHECK: MATCH 196 cycles
